ectional phone case fit profile for Universal Phone Pouch - XXL.","review_status":"approved"},{"code":"PHONE-UNIVERSAL-PHONE-M","display_name":"Universal Phone Pouch - M","source_category":"5. Phone Cases > Universal Phone Case","notes":"Directional phone case fit profile for Universal Phone Pouch - M.","review_status":"approved"},{"code":"PHONE-SAMSUNG-NOTE-20","display_name":"Samsung Galaxy Note 20","source_category":"5. Phone Cases > 112 Otter Box Defender","notes":"Directional phone case fit profile for Samsung Galaxy Note 20.","review_status":"approved"},{"code":"PHONE-SAMSUNG-S21-PLUS","display_name":"Samsung Galaxy S21 Plus","source_category":"5. Phone Cases > 111 Otter Box Symmetry","notes":"Directional phone case fit profile for Samsung Galaxy S21 Plus.","review_status":"approved"},{"code":"PHONE-SAMSUNG-S21","display_name":"Samsung Galaxy S21","source_category":"5. Phone Cases > 111 Otter Box Symmetry","notes":"Directional phone case fit profile for Samsung Galaxy S21.","review_status":"approved"},{"code":"PHONE-SPECIAL-ORDER-CASE","display_name":"Model Recorded in Sale Note","source_category":"5. Phone Cases","notes":"Generic special-order case item. Staff must record the requested phone model and case type in the sale note.","review_status":"approved"}]$profiles$::jsonb) as x(
